    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάθ-ετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθίημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put in secretly, suborned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προέδρους ἐ. ὑφέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					368e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				3.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				20.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				6.5.2
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, δημηγορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a child, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσποιητός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				56
			</span></i>.</div>
